; One variable: `split_offsets` with several entries, on a SplitContainer with three children.
; Every other SplitContainer fixture has one dragger and one offset, all the deprecated scalar
; `split_offset` carries. `_update_dragger_positions` (`split_container.cpp:651-656`) adds entry
; `i` to default dragger `i`, then clamps it into `_get_valid_range(i)` (`:318-337`) on its own.

